WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.130
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:07.109
Today, I’m going to explain an American
science fiction drama film called “Equals.”

00:00:07.109 --> 00:00:08.559
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:09.844
Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:15.849
The movie begins in a futuristic world.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:19.050
Mankind went through a devastating war a century
earlier.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.550
The war only left two peninsulae suitable
for inhabitants.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:26.380
One of the peninsulae works under a legislative
body called the collective.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:31.039
The collective has set extreme rules and laws
to make sure such a war does not emerge again.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:34.580
The citizens of the peninsula are called the
‘members’, and the collective monitors

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.230
and controls all of the member’s actions.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:41.210
With a futuristic approach to solving the
problem, everyone in the peninsula is made

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:42.690
mentally stable.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:45.670
All emotions and diseases have been eradicated.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.790
People live an automated life; they do not
talk to each other unless they have to.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:54.327
The concept of friendship and relationship
is gone, and any show of emotion is considered illegal.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:01:00.550
Marriage is non-existent and any form of sexual
activity is contrary to society's rules.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:04.199
Babies are born strictly through artificial
insemination.

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:07.850
On the other hand, no one knows what is in
the other peninsula.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:11.240
People assume that primitive human emotions
are allowed there.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.450
Silas is a member of the peninsula.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:16.890
He too is mentally stabilized and is void
of any emotions.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.350
He works as an illustrator at Atmos.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:23.546
When Silas walks out of his futuristic home,
we see that everyone around him is in white attire.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:28.800
Large skyscrapers spread throughout the city,
and everyone seems to be automated.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:33.630
As per usual, he walks into his workplace,
a voice announces a disease called the Switched-On

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:38.440
Syndrome, more commonly called SOS; it is
a condition in the members of the peninsula,

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:43.119
where their mental stabilization stops working,
and they start to get their emotions back.

00:01:43.119 --> 00:01:46.509
It has four stages and is considered fatal
by ‘the collective’.

00:01:46.509 --> 00:01:50.280
The members are daily reminded of the effects
of SOS via an announcement.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:54.439
Nia is Sila’s colleague and a fellow member
of the peninsula.

00:01:54.439 --> 00:01:58.109
That day at lunch, the members eat in their
outdoor cafeteria.

00:01:58.109 --> 00:02:02.420
While they engage in a conversation about
work, Nia stays especially quiet.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:06.587
While returning home that night, Silas comes
across two guards restraining a man named David.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.050
A woman who is also restrained screams David’s
name in dismay.

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:14.300
The two are suffering from SOS and have gained
their emotions back.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:18.060
They are being taken into a facility called
DEN, Defective

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.650
Emotional Neuropathy.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
DEN was established by ‘the collective’
to hold in the patients suffering from SOS.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.710
While not many people know of what occurs
inside the place, it is rumored that the people

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:32.880
from the 4th stage get killed mercilessly
as the stage is beyond healing.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.610
The display of emotions unsettles Silas.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.360
He then comes back to his apartment and we
get a full view of it.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:42.210
It doesn’t have any decoration or furniture
and is highly modernized.

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:46.170
To pass his time, Silas plays a futuristic
puzzle game.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:50.800
The following day, Silas listens to the news,
which reports that David and his partner were

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:54.080
arrested for being engaged in sexual activities.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:58.463
As Silas and his team work that day, a man
jumps from the top of the building to commit suicide.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:02.450
The team watches the dead body and talks about
it coldly.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:06.150
Just then, Silas notices signs of human emotions
in Nia.

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:08.700
Her hands are tightened and she seems nervous.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:11.160
He notices the oddness but doesn’t think
much of it.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:15.880
Later, they are in an auditorium watching
a presentation, where Silas cannot stop looking

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:16.880
at Nia.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:20.710
At night, he eats quickly and seems to be
enjoying his food.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:25.510
He doesn’t play with puzzles either; he
is beginning to go out of his automated personality.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:29.890
He dreams of his trying to commit suicide
and wakes up in distress and hits his head.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.810
This is the first time he has ever had a nightmare.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:37.140
The following day, he goes to the doctor where
he meets a man named Jonas, who is in level

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:38.750
two of SOS.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:42.870
The doctor checks Silas, and it turns out
that he has level one SOS.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.090
He asks the doctor if he has to go to the
DEN,[sPause time="0.2s" ePause] but the doctor

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:49.530
assures him that cure at level one is easy
and possible.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.540
At lunch, Silas again keeps staring at Nia.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.230
He seems to be observing her facial features.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:59.740
Silas gets his medication for SOS and takes
it at night, while listening to a voice narrating

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.120
the effects and causes of SOS.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:07.140
The voice adds that people with the last stage
of SOS, stage four, are taken to DEN and are

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.390
electrocuted for showing emotions.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.530
The sick will go through a pain-free death
scenario.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:16.739
The following day at work, Silas cannot concentrate
and is distressed.

00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:20.160
He even cries while working and tries to hide
it from his colleagues.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.669
He follows Nia around work at all times.

00:04:22.669 --> 00:04:26.800
The next morning, he switches his work with
a colleague to get closer to Nia.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:31.330
As she explains the work to him, he doesn’t
seem to concentrate and keeps staring at her.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:35.740
Silas stays late after work and listens to
Nia’s recorded voice on her computer.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.240
He has begun falling in love with her.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:42.150
The next day, Silas and his team are in a
meeting, when he accidentally drops a mug

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.360
of coffee.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.430
He admits that he is suffering from level
one SOS.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:50.550
The group collectively decides that Silas
should stay as far as possible while working,

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.879
so that the others feel more comfortable.

00:04:52.879 --> 00:04:56.669
After work, as Nia leaves for her apartment,
Silas follows her.

00:04:56.669 --> 00:05:01.580
Nia catches him in the act but Silas in turn
questions her if she has SOS too.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:05.267
He tells her about him noticing her demure
change when the guy committed suicide that week.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.419
Nia insists she is fine and leaves.

00:05:08.419 --> 00:05:13.169
The following day at work, Silas stays as
far as possible from everyone, but doesn’t

00:05:13.169 --> 00:05:14.539
stop looking at Nia.

00:05:14.539 --> 00:05:17.430
The two act like the conversation yesterday
never happened.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:19.330
Both of them work late that day.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:22.210
Nia goes to the bathroom and Silas follows
her.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.120
He gets into her bathroom stall and goes inside.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.280
The two are close when they touch each other
for the first time.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:30.320
Silas feels Nia’s face in awe.

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:34.860
Nia reveals that she has had SOS for a year
now; she never went to the doctor because

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.139
she was afraid of being sent to the DEN. [sPause
time="0.2s" ePause]

00:05:38.139 --> 00:05:42.020
She then tells him that their being together
is too risky, so they can’t meet like this again.

00:05:42.849 --> 00:05:45.199
The two get up and finally kiss.

00:05:45.199 --> 00:05:48.909
It is now the next day, and everyone has left
the office except the two.

00:05:48.909 --> 00:05:52.449
Nia again leaves for the restroom and Silas
follows.

00:05:52.449 --> 00:05:56.749
The two hold onto each other, but are too
afraid to move on with the relationship.

00:05:56.749 --> 00:05:58.189
They kiss again.

00:05:58.189 --> 00:06:01.680
From the following day, they start sneaking
into the restroom every day.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:04.460
They laugh, talk, and kiss.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.720
The two are falling in love.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:11.809
One day, Atmos’s manager, Leonard, comes
into the restroom while the two are together.

00:06:11.809 --> 00:06:15.120
Nia stays hidden while Silas goes out and
talks to him.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:19.389
As it turns out, someone had reported Silas’s
strange behavior to Leonard.

00:06:19.389 --> 00:06:23.729
He warns Silas of the consequences of sneaking
around, and leaves.

00:06:23.729 --> 00:06:27.719
The two talk on their way back home, and Silas
tells her that he will look for another job

00:06:27.719 --> 00:06:32.039
to not get caught, so the next day, Silas
resigns from his job.

00:06:32.039 --> 00:06:36.510
A man named Dominic replaces him as Silas
gets a new job at a nursery.

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:40.539
At night, while picking up medicines, Silas
meets Jonas again.

00:06:40.539 --> 00:06:44.409
The two talk for a while and Jonas reveals
that he is a part of a support group with

00:06:44.409 --> 00:06:46.849
people who are suffering from SOS.

00:06:46.849 --> 00:06:49.139
He offers to help Silas if he needs it.

00:06:49.139 --> 00:06:54.879
Soon, Silas visits the support group and meets
its members namely Bess, Peter, Thomas Gil,

00:06:54.879 --> 00:06:56.259
Max, and Alice.

00:06:56.259 --> 00:07:00.310
There, he finds out that half the patients
brought to DEN commit suicide as the staff

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.909
encourages them.

00:07:01.909 --> 00:07:04.080
Some even watch them kill themselves.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:08.629
As opposed to electro restraints, suicide
seems more preferable to everyone.

00:07:08.629 --> 00:07:10.410
Silas is shocked.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.839
Later that night, Nia knocks on his door.

00:07:12.839 --> 00:07:15.789
He brings her inside and she breaks down crying.

00:07:15.789 --> 00:07:17.610
She had missed him too much.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:20.870
One thing leads to another and the two end
up having sex.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.819
From the following day, the two meet every
night at Silas’s apartment.

00:07:24.819 --> 00:07:27.900
Silas has completely stopped taking his medication.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:30.550
The two are beyond happy with their lifestyle.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:35.849
That is until one morning, they hear the announcement
that a medication to treat SOS has been made.

00:07:35.849 --> 00:07:40.289
The announcer suggests everyone who has been
diagnosed with SOS to take the medicine.

00:07:40.289 --> 00:07:42.469
SOS of any level can be treated with it.

00:07:42.469 --> 00:07:47.660
Scared that they will not be able to feel
anymore, Silas and Nia go to the support group.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:50.400
They have decided to run away to the other
peninsula.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.550
Bess tells them that it is not a good idea,
but they have made their decision.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:57.319
They decide to leave in three days with Jonas’s
help.

00:07:57.319 --> 00:08:00.530
However, Nia gets a conception call from ‘the
collective’.

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.100
They want her to artificially bear a child.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:06.969
If the doctor checks her blood results, they
will diagnose her with SOS.

00:08:06.969 --> 00:08:12.020
Scared, she tells this to Silas who asks her
to meet him at the clinic after her appointment.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.610
At the clinic, the doctor informs Nia that
she is pregnant.

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:19.319
Silas sees two guards taking her away, but
he cannot do anything.

00:08:19.319 --> 00:08:21.599
They take her to DEN. [sPause time="0.2s"
ePause]

00:08:21.599 --> 00:08:25.620
Silas frantically asks Jonas for help, who
tells him to go home and wait for a couple

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:26.620
of hours.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:31.909
Bess, who is also a worker at DEN, frees Nia
and takes her to the rest of the support group.

00:08:31.909 --> 00:08:34.399
They make her dress up as fast as she can.

00:08:34.399 --> 00:08:38.610
Bess then explains to her that a patient named
Eva had killed herself last night.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:41.060
Bess has changed her records to Nia’s.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.280
So now Nia can live freely as Eva.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:47.750
Nia runs away to Silas’s apartment but is
surprised when she doesn’t find him there.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:52.690
Meanwhile, Silas is at work where it is announced
in the news that Max had reported Bess, Jonas

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.080
and Gilead.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:57.650
So now, all three of them were cured and void
of emotions.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:01.290
He then runs to DEN’s headquarters and asks
a worker about Nia.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.170
He informs him of her death.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.870
Silas is devastated.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.519
He goes blank and starts having a panic attack.

00:09:07.519 --> 00:09:10.840
Nia goes searching for him when he doesn’t
return back to the apartment.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:15.589
Meanwhile, Silas climbs on top of Atmos’s
building to commit suicide.

00:09:15.589 --> 00:09:18.760
As he is about to jump, he changes his decision.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:22.420
When he gets back to his apartment, he is
greeted by a worried Nia.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.089
She immediately notices the mark on his neck.

00:09:25.089 --> 00:09:27.230
Silas has been cured of SOS.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:31.670
Nia asks him why he did that, to which he
replies that he thought she was dead.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:36.100
The cure only takes effect in six hours, so
he only has one more hour before his emotions

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.250
go away.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:41.040
Nia is still pregnant, so she asks Silas to
fight the cure.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:44.290
The two still decide to go through the plan
to run away.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:48.680
The next morning, Silas remembers that he
loved her but doesn’t feel it anymore.

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.740
He tells her to get dressed to go to the train
as they had decided.

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:55.959
In the train, Nia is disappointed as Silas
sits two seats away from her.

00:09:55.959 --> 00:09:58.430
Nia reminisces of all the good times with
Silas.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:02.820
Just then, he sits on the seat beside her
and holds her hand, suggesting that he will

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.132
soon recover and gain his emotions back.

00:10:05.132 --> 00:10:07.620
